Convergence of the repair target
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Each pass feeds the achieved delay back as the next target, so the
  reported Fmax is a converged measurement rather than a function of the
  probe period.
    iteration 0: target   40.000 ns -> delay   10.197 ns (slack +29.803 ns)
    iteration 1: target   10.197 ns -> delay   10.197 ns (slack +0.000 ns)

